Part C — Comprehensions (11–15)


11.List comprehension for squares 1–10
# Normal way
squares = []
for i in range(1, 11):
    squares.append(i * i)

# Comprehension way — same result, one line
# Squares — you want i*i, so first part changes
squares = [i * i for i in range(1, 11)]


12.List of even numbers using comprehension
